{

"{\"reflection\": \"Previous bids in the absence of active asks resulted in no trades, indicating that placing bids without potential sellers is unproductive. It's crucial to align bids with existing asks to ensure profitability.\", \"plan_for_this_hour\": \"With the Ask Queue currently empty, placing a bid would not result in a trade. The optimal strategy is to withhold a bid this hour to avoid unprofitable commitments and focus on monitoring the Ask Queue for future opportunities.\", \"bid\": \"null\", \"new_memory\": \"In Hour #11, the Ask Queue was empty, so no bid was placed to avoid unprofitable commitments.\", \"scratch_pad_update\": \"#### Observations: The Ask Queue remains empty, confirming no active sellers are present.#### Thoughts: Withholding a bid in the absence of asks prevents wasting resources on non-existent trade opportunities.#### Updated Strategy: Maintain a wait-and-observe approach, only placing bids when the Ask Queue has entries that align with our profit margin (below $100). Prioritize responsiveness to new ask entries in subsequent hours.\"}"  											
